# edge cases from a request must give an error or a result, not a crash
Server init.

Sephetho ngola: ['<'] + (['abc'] ho-tloha: 0 bolelele: 0, litlhaku-tse-kholo) + ['>'], mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ['<'] + (['abc'] ho-tloha: 0 bolelele: 0, litlhaku-tse-nyane) + ['>'], mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ['<'] + (['abc'] tlola: 3, litlhaku-tse-kholo) + ['>'], mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: [''] litlhaku-tse-kholo bytes, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ['aB'] litlhaku-tse-kholo, mola-o-mocha.
Sephetho ngola: ['aB'] litlhaku-tse-nyane, mola-o-mocha.

Sephetho ngola: (Motsotso-nako ncha: 0) selemo, mola-o-mocha.
{ Motsotso-nako ncha: ['9e300'] palo. } tšoasa: { :e Sephetho ngola: e, mola-o-mocha. }, qala.
{ Motsotso-nako ncha: ['-9e300'] palo. } tšoasa: { :e Sephetho ngola: e, mola-o-mocha. }, qala.
{ Motsotso-nako ncha: ['nan'] palo. } tšoasa: { :e Sephetho ngola: e, mola-o-mocha. }, qala.
{ Motsotso-nako ncha: 9000000000000000000. } tšoasa: { :e Sephetho ngola: e, mola-o-mocha. }, qala.
